366
00:44:35,452 --> 00:44:39,252
隠し切れずに溢れていた 優しさだった
overflowing because they couldn't be hidden, that was your kindness.

367
00:44:39,402 --> 00:44:42,352
あの日もそうだった
It was like that that day too.

368
00:44:42,402 --> 00:44:46,152
あれは二人最後の思い出
That was the last memory for both of us.

369
